"Include it in your gamemode and call %s_CreateTextDraws()\n"
"from OnGameModeInit and %s_ShowTextDraws(playerid)."
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"Подключите его в gamemode и вызовите %s_CreateTextDraws()\n"
"из OnGameModeInit и %s_ShowTextDraws(playerid)."

msgid ""
